<title>UK: IFC sets 2.0 billion Lux franc March 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>IFC sets 2.0 billion Lux franc March 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat and Credit Communal/Gemeenten.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    15.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.60    PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.22 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
